{"id":"a0adb8444eeba120","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-settheoretic-completeness.md","title":"Set-Theoretic Completeness for I and J","display":"thm-settheoretic-completeness — Set-Theoretic Completeness for I and J","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-settheoretic-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-settheoretic-completeness"],"display":"thm-settheoretic-completeness — Set-Theoretic Completeness for I and J","depends_on":["[[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-realization]]","[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-language]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-models]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-settheoretic-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-settheoretic-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-settheoretic-completeness — Set-Theoretic Completeness for I and J"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb6343156d01ef0\" href=\"?note=0cb6343156d01ef0\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics\">89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"580b00b43dcd196a\" href=\"?note=580b00b43dcd196a\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-realization\">89-df-settheoretic-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab51daf02675e633\" href=\"?note=ab51daf02675e633\" title=\"89-df-finite-prewellorder\">89-df-finite-prewellorder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"22c2c4cecc692616\" href=\"?note=22c2c4cecc692616\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-language\">89-df-settheoretic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"178d313a2e1d8881\" href=\"?note=178d313a2e1d8881\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-models\">89-df-settheoretic-models</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}},\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}\">\\(\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}},\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}\\)</span> 取已经完整定义的集合论翻译；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{InfL}\">\\(\\mathsf{InfL}\\)</span> 表示无限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha\\models\\mathrm{ZF}+V=L\">\\(L_\\alpha\\models\\mathrm{ZF}+V=L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{InfInacc}\">\\(\\mathsf{InfInacc}\\)</span> 表示无限多个强不可达基数。两个谓词在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"178d313a2e1d8881\" href=\"?note=178d313a2e1d8881\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-models\">89-df-settheoretic-models</a> 中给出，不在此共同假设，也不添作 ZF/ZFC 对象公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>框架部分不附加这两个集合论假设。算术式/集合论可证性对应分别由其显示的前提控制；I 使用 ZF，J 使用 ZFC。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>框架量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\">\\(\\forall F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F=(W,R)\">\\(\\forall F=(W,R)\\)</span> 的域为所有集合对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\">\\((W,R)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span>；不对任意非框架集合调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\models A\">\\(F\\models A\\)</span> 或框架性质谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm I&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\to F\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfL}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm I\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZF}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}}(A))\\right),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm J&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F=(W,R)\\\\\n\\left[(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\to F\\models A\\right],\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfInacc}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm J\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}(A))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm I&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\to F\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfL}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm I\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZF}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}}(A))\\right),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm J&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F=(W,R)\\\\\n\\left[(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\to F\\models A\\right],\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfInacc}&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm J\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}(A))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 13 章，印刷页 167–175；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\nSolovay 的两项对应定理；原书分别用传递模型构造与不可达宇宙数目的分层句给出反解释，可靠性利用集合模型满足关系与相应绝对性。框架完全性本身不依赖大基数；显示的外部假设为完整集合论解释对应提供来源支持。原书 p.165 的选择公理约定用于 pp.173–175 的不可达宇宙定理，本条因此把其对象理论明确为 ZFC；I 的对象理论仍是 ZF。此条引用原书完整证明，未将集合论模型构造机械展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics","status":"resolved","id":"0cb6343156d01ef0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"580b00b43dcd196a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-prewellorder","status":"resolved","id":"ab51daf02675e633","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-language","status":"resolved","id":"22c2c4cecc692616","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-models","status":"resolved","id":"178d313a2e1d8881","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-models","status":"resolved","id":"178d313a2e1d8881","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{InfL}$ 表示无限多个 $\\alpha$ 使 $L_\\alpha\\models\\mathrm{ZF}+V=L$；$\\mathsf{InfInacc}$ 表示无限多个强不可达基数。两个谓词在 [[89-df-settheoretic-models]] 中给出，不在此共同假设，也不添作 ZF/ZFC 对象公理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}},\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{InfL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\alpha\\models\\mathrm{ZF}+V=L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{InfInacc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm I&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\to F\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfL}&\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm I\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZF}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm{tm}}(A))\\right),\\\\\nA\\in\\mathrm J&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall F=(W,R)\\\\\n\\left[(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x\\in W(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\to F\\models A\\right],\\\\\n\\mathsf{InfInacc}&\\Longrightarrow\\left(A\\in\\mathrm J\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\ (\\mathrm{ZFC}\\vdash\\tau_r^{\\mathrm u}(A))\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2756,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-realization]] → [[89-thm-settheoretic-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["0cb6343156d01ef0","580b00b43dcd196a","ab51daf02675e633","dbba58e7bd3b0667","22c2c4cecc692616","178d313a2e1d8881"]}